      "value": "# Verificar blockNumber no Node-1:\ncurl -s -X POST --data '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"eth_blockNumber\",\"params\":[],\"id\":1}' http://52.72.51.216:8545\n\n# Verificar peers conectados (deve retornar 0x5 com 6 nós):\ncurl -s -X POST --data '{\"jsonrpc\":\"2.0\",\"method\":\"net_peerCount\",\"params\":[],\"id\":1}' http://52.72.51.216:8545\n",
